WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.013 --> 00:00:02.515
Print experiment worksheet

2
00:00:02.515 --> 00:00:09.210
Open the workflow note

3
00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:12.539
The QR icon at the top of the note shows its ID

4
00:00:12.539 --> 00:00:16.941
The worksheet's QR codes bring photos back to this note by this ID

5
00:00:16.941 --> 00:00:22.996
Run Print experiment worksheet from the palette

6
00:00:22.996 --> 00:00:25.730
Lab unit operations are already turned on

7
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:27.841
Pick A4 or Letter paper

8
00:00:27.841 --> 00:00:31.118
Print opens the print dialog (not shown in video)

9
00:00:31.118 --> 00:00:36.816
If that fails, open it in the browser. Print at 100% scale
